 military targets including the Shaybah oilfield, an Aramco site in Yanbu, King Khalid airport in Riyadh and Abha airport; Saudi damage was not confirmed in the report.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9811703/Yemens-Houthis-Carried-out-several-attacks-against-Saudi-Arabia-energy-airports-and-military-targets-including-Aramco-site-in-Yanbu.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.145, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "3194427485e9", "ts": "2026-10-15T14:43:43Z", "title": "Saudi-led coalition says Houthis attempted to attack dozens of Saudi facilities", "summary": "The Saudi-led coalition said the Houthis attempted to attack dozens of Saudi facilities, a day after Houthi fire was intercepted over the Medina region and following the strike on Aramco's Dhahran headquarters.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQODZXb0UtbHJiTHdmLTZhUENYcXNNeVptZDFGV1pUUEpuS3A0RzROVlBWSGw2V2tvdjNabmlnX1llVmh1Tno5TW5jUjhLWm5BY3VOREdYTnd5Q2RpdmdyVnVzR0lFTlp4SDV4a3JzNWo0US1xdER1eUkybkRtOHlBT2U4RE43NFI2dGVnb29fSmdPVmVPaDY3NG5fNXRabFR5dkJBU0pwNDFZSkN0NkxaU2lEd2c1Mk9HbUNUYTROV3BJUnh3TEE?oc=5", "source": "Reuters", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Saudi Arabia", "c": 0.141, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "e2d02bb4c464", "ts": "2026-10-19T15:02:46Z", "title": "Department of War and BAE Systems sign framework to surge counter-drone production", "summary": "The US Department of War and BAE Systems signed a framework agreement to surge production of counter-drone systems.", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "source": "U.S. Department of War", "scale": "minor", "category": "corporate", "region": "US", "c": 0.114, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "41e7e5d7ce2a", "ts": "2026-10-19T15:49:57Z", "title": "Russian strike kills six in Kharkiv region as Zelensky says US is delaying 'vital supplies'", "summary": "Ukraine said a Russian attack killed six people at a park in the Kharkiv region, including three children; Zelensky said Russia struck without warning from partners and the US was delaying vital supplies.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPRmNtTjh5cENNZWdxNHBuWUF6Sk1PSjZQY1NzUWp0MkhUMmZsdl83UkFCem9TTHRqUXFoeHZXcWU2bUc0ZnN0Nnc3NUxERDFzb01Td2FNOEVBRzhOdFdlQ09nYlJHSzlfZEt1V3JUQURYYUg2Wjhqc3FvYzlOZGVXbzdpZmNfT0RzVDVZVjJ2SXlmVURpZmpCTklUMDZHQ1hucFNZdC1DcThVbUFVVFB6YldxMkJYQWNfM0VseHp3UWc1Z3dF?oc=5", "source": "Reuters", "scale": "minor", "category": "conflict", "region": "Europe", "c": 0.099, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "8cff3a3045a5", "ts": "2026-10-16T14:01:00Z", "title": "Ukrainian drones hit Surgut condensate plant in Russia's largest oil-producing region", "summary": "A suspected Ukrainian drone attack started a fire at an industrial facility in the Surgut district of Khanty-Mansi, identified by residents as Gazprom Pererabotka's Surgut Condensate Stabilization Plant, Russia's largest such facility; it appears to be the first strike on energy infrastructure in the region, and Surgut and Kogalym airports were restricted.", "url": "https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/10/16/ukrainian-drones-strike-energy-plant-in-russias-largest-oil-producing-region-a94008", "source": "The Moscow Times", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Russia", "c": 0.097, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "20a0fb9611bf", "ts": "2026-10-16T10:56:20Z", "title": "Poland scrambles fighter jets as Russia strikes western Ukraine", "summary": "Poland scrambled fighter jets as Russia launched strikes on western Ukraine near the Polish border, a day after Kyiv said it would resume refinery strikes.", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/poland-scrambles-fighter-jets-as-russia-strikes-western-ukraine?traffic_source=rss", "source": "Al Jazeera", "scale": "minor", "category": "conflict", "region": "Europe", "c": 0.096, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "e72d6f25b8b6", "ts": "2026-10-19T14:26:39Z", "title": "Saudi Arabia to postpone in-person 'Davos in the Desert' after Houthi attacks", "summary": "The FT reported Saudi Arabia will postpone the in-person Future Investment Initiative after Houthi attacks; Fars separately reported sirens and an explosion in Riyadh the same hour.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9811526/Saudi-Arabia-to-postpone-in-person-Davos-in-the-Desert-event-after-Houthi-attacks---FT.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice / FT", "scale": "minor", "category": "conflict", "region": "Middle East", "c": 0.093, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "d38c8ed85e6c", "ts": "2026-10-19T08:42:49Z", "title": "Zelensky offers to halt strikes on Russian refineries in exchange for more Patriot missiles", "summary": "Zelensky said Ukraine could stop striking Russian refineries if it received more US Patriot interceptors, calling that the minimum acceptable; Ukraine resumed refinery strikes on October 15.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE0ycjEyWHJYaUlpNy1Bc3RTdHk5OXhzSUxFSWZYampScjZKQmpiSzNiYTE0TWRPN3JxXzh4MGRzd21vRGQwXzZiSkdZdw?oc=5", "source": "Kyiv Post", "scale": "minor", "category": "conflict", "region": "Europe", "c": -0.092, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "3d96a21d2600", "ts": "2026-10-19T08:05:18Z", "title": "Massive overnight Russian attack leaves over half a million Ukrainians without power", "summary": "Zelensky said a large overnight Russian missile and drone attack on energy infrastructure left more than 500,000 Ukrainians without electricity.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1jR3NQel9jQUVIUFo0ZlVIM0xKU2lmX1ZfN0xXRnA4VzVTeWNZMVVHRGZDeXJHc0RRR3U5YU5OSGVpQlMxcWNLU3p3cnR4R2k1V25GOGZ3aVZYYjJtQW1r?oc=5", "source": "The Jerusalem Post", "scale": "minor", "category": "conflict", "region": "Europe", "c": 0.092, "via": "defense"}, {"id": "8456e147321e", "ts": "2026-10-17T12:41:00Z", "title": "IRGC says a second supertanker hit a naval mine in Hormuz and declares the strait closed", "summary": "Iran's IRGC said a second supertanker struck a naval m